    "description": "Violates ONLY the \"node_with_contract\" rule: the topology is sound and the edges have a condition, but the publicar_texto node declares no contract. With no contract there is no way to verify what the node produced — it is the node the synthesizer composed by hallucination (README, principle 3). The rule holds identically for a gate, which is a node like any other.",
